{
  "_comment": [
    "The real index from https://software.aloecraft.org/releases/diluvium/releases.json,",
    "captured 2026-09-24, twelve days after diluvium left Lua's numbering for its",
    "own: v5.5.1_build14 was the last of the Lua era and v0.15.1 the first of the",
    "new line (doc/Alignment.md \u00a71). All nineteen releases are here, in the",
    "index's own order, which is newest first by publish date.",
    "",
    "Trimmed, not edited. Each release keeps the fields the Lab reads -- tag,",
    "name, version, published_at, stable -- and its assets are cut to the two",
    "the Lab fetches. Dropped: notes, summary, upgrading, sums, facts and",
    "verified_upstream, which are prose and a second copy of SHA256SUMS.txt,",
    "and which took this file from 3 KB to 136 KB.",
    "",
    "It pins three things at once. The two eras order correctly against each",
    "other and within themselves, including the one patch release, build12p1.",
    "And `stable` is the only word this index has for a prerelease: it is",
    "generated from diluvium's changelog now, and `prerelease` is gone."
  ],
